# Quarto/knitr chunk cache — a plain top-level cache/ directory has
# started showing up alongside the doc-specific *_cache/ directories
# above (gn-viz_*.RData, km-viz_*.rdb/.rdx, leiden-viz_*, louvain-viz_*,
# __packages — all knitr::cache-related artifacts, none of them meant
# to be committed, regenerable on any render). Ignoring the whole
# directory rather than trying to enumerate every hashed chunk-cache
# filename.
cache/

